Error: Jet.InvalidViaParameter: `-[via n]>` on `invoke` names a parameter that isn't a callback
  --> Tests/UI/Effects/effect_via_non_callback_param_is_e0748.jet:1:26
    |
  1 | invoke: fn(n: Int) -[via n]> { print("{n}") }
    |                          ^
 Why: `n` has type `Int`, not a function type with an effect row
 Fix: Point `via` at a function parameter, or remove the `via` annotation
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.InvalidViaParameter
